---
---

<section class="relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-bg-dark">
  <!-- Decorative Soft Stars -->
  <div class="soft-star w-80 h-80 bg-gold-soft/30 top-20 -left-40"></div>
  <div class="soft-star w-64 h-64 bg-rose/20 bottom-40 right-10"></div>
  <div class="soft-star w-96 h-96 bg-primary-blue-light/20 top-1/2 left-1/3"></div>

  <!-- Content -->
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center pt-24">
    <!-- Eyebrow -->
    <p class="font-utility text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-gold mb-6">
      Law Student Association for Legal Practice
    </p>

    <!-- Main Headline -->
    <h1 class="font-heading text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-semibold leading-[0.95] mb-8">
      <span class="text-pale-cream">Membangun</span><br />
      <span class="text-gradient-gold">Bakat Hukum</span><br />
      <span class="text-pale-cream">Masa Depan</span>
    </h1>

    <!-- Subheadline -->
    <p class="font-body text-lg md:text-xl text-pale-cream/60 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12 leading-relaxed">
      Sejak 1987, LaSALe menjadi wadah pengembangan kompetensi praktik hukum bagi mahasiswa Fakultas Hukum Universitas Indonesia.
    </p>

    <!-- CTA Buttons -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 mb-20">
      <a href="/programs" class="btn btn-primary">
        Jelajahi Program
      </a>
      <a href="/about" class="btn btn-outline">
        Tentang LaSALe
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- ED Preface -->
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto border-l-2 border-gold/30 pl-6 text-left">
      <p class="font-script text-2xl text-gold mb-3">Executive Director's Note</p>
      <p class="font-body text-sm text-pale-cream/50 italic leading-relaxed">
        "Setiap tahun, LaSALe menghadirkan program-program yang dirancang untuk membekali mahasiswa hukum dengan keterampilan praktis yang dibutuhkan di dunia profesional hukum."
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Wave Divider -->
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full overflow-hidden leading-none">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 120" preserveAspectRatio="none" class="w-full h-16 md:h-24">
      <path
        d="M0,60 C240,120 480,0 720,60 C960,120 1200,0 1440,60 L1440,120 L0,120 Z"
        fill="#2A2A2A"
        fill-opacity="0.5"
      />
      <path
        d="M0,80 C360,20 720,100 1080,40 C1200,20 1320,60 1440,80 L1440,120 L0,120 Z"
        fill="#2A2A2A"
      />
    </svg>
  </div>
</section>
